  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">Hi all，<br />【映客527】活动已上线，活动时间2026年5月15日-5月27日，现同步活动Day6数据。</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">一、完成情况：</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">活动目标：活动钻石消耗达2.16e钻石<br />目标完成度：活动消耗达5095万钻石，目标完成度为23.59%</p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>目标</td><td>消耗</td><td>完成度</td><td>日期进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>216,000,000</td><td>50,945,376</td><td>23.59%</td><td>46.15%</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">活动消耗占比大盘消耗的21.53%，专属礼物消耗占比大盘礼物消耗的36.01%；</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">其中普通礼物消耗3568万钻，非礼物消耗580万钻，特殊礼物消耗946万钻。</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 145.6pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 124.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 62.4pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.8pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 104.0pt;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 109.2pt;\" /><col class=\"\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>总消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>功能消耗</td><td>活动合计</td><td>礼物墙消耗</td><td>非礼物消耗</td><td>特殊礼物消耗</td><td>活动礼物占比</td><td>活动占大盘比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,515</td><td>40,100,727</td><td>22,283,652</td><td>17,817,075</td><td>8,677,857</td><td>6,484,413</td><td><br /></td><td>2,193,444</td><td>21.64%</td><td>21.64%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,516</td><td>35,911,762</td><td>18,824,800</td><td>17,086,962</td><td>9,154,305</td><td>6,017,237</td><td>1,562,638</td><td>1,574,430</td><td>21.14%</td><td>25.49%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20,260,517</td><td>32,181,754</td><td>13,989,902</td><td>18,191,852</td><td>6,550,287